Description:
Kosim Robotics provides AI-powered service robots designed for real world operations. Our robots are designed to operate in active commercial environments such as warehousing/logistics, hospitality, commercial real estate, and healthcare.

We partner with leading robotics manufacturers to bring advanced autonomous robots to organizations across North America. Our focus is simple: help businesses successfully deploy intelligent robotics that improve operational efficiency, consistency, and safety. By introducing proven robotics solutions into everyday workflows, we help organizations automate repetitive tasks so teams can focus on higher value work.

Kosim Robotics supports customers throughout the full lifecycle of robotics adoption, including:
• Identifying the right robotic solutions for operational needs;
• Deploying robots within existing facilities and workflows;
• Providing training and operational support;
• Ensuring reliable performance through preventative maintenance and repairs.

We believe robotics should be practical, reliable, and ready for everyday business operations.
